# oracle: fix srd with shift yes and collision noslip, big spheres of three sizes, 2d (cut-down of examples/ASPHERE/poly/in.poly: 4x4 big particles, 85 SRD per unit area, 400 SRD steps)
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10 skip=f_2[5] atomskip=fx,fy,fz
# Measured with native LAMMPS (black box): with the tolerance tightened to 1e-13 (abs 1e-13) the engine agrees with every thermo column except f_2[5], and with the positions and velocities of every atom. f_2[5] (the count of rescaled SRD velocities) is skipped: at step 180 one SRD particle has v^2 equal to vmax^2 within 2 ulp, and the rounding of the earlier steps puts it on the other side of the rescale test in the engine (one more rescale than native). The count is an integer, so no tolerance closes it. The forces (fx, fy, fz) are skipped (atomskip): native reports nonzero forces (|f| up to 10) on four SRD atoms (ids 17, 21, 29, 31 in the final dump) that the engine leaves at zero; SRD atoms are not integrated by fix nve and their positions and velocities agree, so the big-particle forces are checked through the trajectory instead.
units		lj
atom_style	sphere
atom_modify	first big
dimension	2

lattice		sq 0.3
region		box block 0 4 0 4 -0.5 0.5
create_box	4 box
create_atoms	1 region box

group		big type 1
set		group big type/fraction 2 0.33 394895
set		group big type/fraction 3 0.5 989894
group		big type 2 3
set		type 1*3 mass 1.0
velocity	big create 1.44 87287 loop geom

pair_style	lj/cut 1.12
pair_coeff	1 1 1.0 1.0 1.12
pair_coeff	2 2 1.0 2.0 2.24
pair_coeff	3 3 1.0 1.5 1.68
pair_coeff	4 4 0.0 1.0 0.0

neighbor	0.3 bin
neigh_modify	delay 0 every 1 check yes

fix		1 big nve
fix		2 all enforce2d
run		100
unfix		1
unfix		2

region		plane block INF INF INF INF -0.001 0.001 units box
lattice		sq 85.0
create_atoms	4 region plane
set		type 4 mass 0.1
group		small type 4
velocity	small create 1.0 593849 loop geom

pair_style	lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff	1 1 1.0 1.0
pair_coeff	2 2 1.0 2.0
pair_coeff	3 3 1.0 1.5
pair_coeff	1 4 0.0 1.0 0.5
pair_coeff	2 4 0.0 1.0 1.0
pair_coeff	3 4 0.0 1.0 0.75
pair_coeff	4 4 0.0 1.0 0.0

delete_atoms	overlap 1.0 small big
reset_timestep	0

neighbor	0.3 multi
neigh_modify	delay 0 every 1 check yes
comm_modify	mode multi group big vel yes
neigh_modify	include big

pair_style	lj/cut 1.12
pair_coeff	1 1 1.0 1.0 1.12
pair_coeff	2 2 1.0 2.0 2.24
pair_coeff	3 3 1.0 1.5 1.68
pair_coeff	4 4 0.0 1.0 0.0

timestep	0.001
fix		1 big nve
fix		2 small srd 20 big 1.0 0.25 49894 shift yes 54979 search 0.2 inside ignore
fix		3 all enforce2d

compute		tbig big temp/sphere
variable	pebig equal pe*atoms/count(big)
variable	ebig equal etotal*atoms/count(big)
thermo_style	custom step temp f_2[8] etotal v_pebig v_ebig press f_2[1] f_2[2] f_2[3] f_2[4] f_2[5] f_2[6] f_2[7] f_2[9] f_2[10] f_2[11]
thermo_modify	temp tbig format float %.15g
thermo		20

run		400
